Since the firm opened its second office we have run two project number seri=
es, one out of Culver City covering Culver City, Irvine and San Francisco, =
and one out of Iselin. Effective October 1 all new projects will draw from =
a single firmwide series beginning at 704000, assigned centrally by contrac=
ts.<br />
<br />
Projects already open keep the numbers they have. That is deliberate, becau=
se renumbering live jobs breaks every executed contract, certificate and su=
bmittal log attached to them.<br />
<br />
The consequence you need to internalize is this. A six digit number issued =
before October 1 is not unique across the firm. There are pairs in the two =
series that collide exactly. From today, when you write a pre-consolidation=
 number in any document that leaves the office, qualify it with the studio =
series.